Contact and Licence:
--------------------
   This package consists of the following files:
      Makefile       - example of cross-platform
                       build. Demonstrates what
                       has to be done.

      README         - This file.

      dynamic.cpp    - Example file containing
                       a module that gets loaded
                       at runtime.

      dynamic.h      - Header for above module.

      main.cpp       - Main file which calls both
                       the static and runtime
                       code.

      slib.c         - The shared library
                       implementation.

      slib.h         - Header for above.
      
      static.cpp     - Example of a module that
                       is loaded at compile time.

      static.h       - Header for above module.

